Package: micropubr
Title: Publication-Ready Microbiome Visualizations
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Konstantinos", "Daniilidis", , "daniilidis@ieee.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A unified, opinionated interface for generating publication-ready
    microbiome figures from 'phyloseq' objects with minimal code. Inspired by
    the design philosophy of 'SCpubr' for single-cell transcriptomics,
    'micropubr' provides a consistent family of 'mp_*()' functions covering
    alpha diversity, beta diversity and ordination, taxonomic composition,
    differential abundance, phylogenetic trees, co-occurrence networks and
    longitudinal analyses. Every function returns a 'ggplot2' object with
    colourblind-safe defaults, automatic statistical overlays and
    auto-generated, reproducible figure captions.
